# Editing Project Documents

The files in `docs/` are approved drafts, not empty placeholders. Do not rewrite one because a code change was easier that way.

## Uncertainty

Keep `NEEDS VERIFICATION` and `NEEDS DECISION` until a human closes them. Do not fill `DATA_SOURCES.md` §5.3 with a website that has not passed the five checks. Do not type a SAM.gov or USAspending deep link that the source doc still marks unverified. Do not set a pgvector width.

## One document

Edit the document the task names. Do not opportunistically revise its neighbors.

## Conflicts

Use the protocol in `documentation-authority.mdc`. Do not quietly change scoring weights, roles, or the source list.
